{
  "dom_id": "step-1021",
  "name": "Introduction",
  "problem": "Consider the function $f(x)$ below:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14193886/assets/e46fcaf79d93513c8b946de51ef451ad8a638936681ce3fc70ffdbe8de023078.svg)\n\nThe function $f(x)$ seems to have a jump discontinuity at $x=-3.$ However, by selecting a particular value for $k$, we can remove the jump discontinuity and make the function continuous.\n\nWe can find this value of $k$ by forcing the left and right-sided limits of the function to be equal at $x=-3\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\lim\\limits_{x\\to (-3)^-} f(x) = \\lim\\limits_{x\\to (-3)^+} f(x)\n$$\n\nFor the left limit, we have,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (-3)^{-}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to (-3)^{-}}(3{x}^{2}+kx) \\\\  & =3(-3)^{2}+k(-3) \\\\  & =27-3k,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand for the right limit, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (-3)^{+}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to (-3)^{+}}{x}^{3} \\\\  & =(-3)^{3} \\\\  & =-27.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the left and right limits as equal, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}27-3k & =-27 \\\\ 3k & =54 \\\\ k & =18.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, to make $f(x)$ continuous at $x=-3,$ we need to choose $k=18.$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-1021\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"1021\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"543\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-1021\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-1\">Introduction</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"1021\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n            